Hey Jan!

You should index things in Stan from 1 not zero. The issue appears to be the line:

    mu[0] ~ normal(1,1)T[0, ];

Which is causing Stan to throw the error (mu[0] out of bounds):

    Exception thrown at line 14: []: accessing element out of range. index 0 out of range; expecting index to be between 1 and 3; index position = 1mu

Hope this helps!

By the way, the mailing list is shutting down soon, so if you have any new questions head over to http://discourse.mc-stan.org/

Ben

