> > > >                           bernoulli_lpmf(1 | alpha)
> > > >                             + bernoulli_lpmf(0 | pi));
> > > >
> > > > It'll avoid NaN values in derivatives (not sure if they'll pop
> > > > up with a -infinity term and then an exp).
